sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Rider App
    participant RS as Ride Service
    participant MS as Match Service
    participant LS as Location Store (Redis)
    participant Maps as Maps Service
    participant D as Driver App
    participant NS as Notification Service

    R->>RS: POST /ride/request {pickupLat, pickupLng, dropLat, dropLng}
    RS->>MS: findNearbyDrivers(pickupLat, pickupLng, radius=2km)
    MS->>LS: GEORADIUS drivers pickupLat pickupLng 2km
    LS-->>MS: [driverId1, driverId2, driverId3] with distances
    MS->>Maps: getETA(driverLocations, pickupLocation)
    Maps-->>MS: ETAs per driver
    MS-->>RS: ranked driver list (by ETA + rating)
    RS->>NS: push offer to top driver
    NS->>D: "New ride request — Accept?"
    alt driver accepts (within 15s)
        D->>RS: POST /ride/accept {rideId, driverId}
        RS->>LS: update ride status → MATCHED
        RS-->>R: 200 {driverId, ETA, driverDetails}
    else driver rejects or timeout
        RS->>NS: push offer to next driver
        Note over RS,D: repeat until accepted or no drivers
    end
